          "jahr": "Jahr (Clarity/Voiced): Trapping of breath due to strong reliance on Makhraj. Letters (19): The remaining letters."
        },
        {
          "pair_name": "2. Shiddah vs. Rakhawah (with Tawasut)",
          "shiddah": "Shiddah (Strength): Severe sound blockage. Letters (8): أَجِدُ قَطْ بَكَتْ",
          "rakhawah": "Rakhawah (Softness): Free running of sound. Letters (16): Remaining letters except Tawasut.",
